---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Partners from '../components/Partners.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Liz Manning — TradeBuilt" description="Liz Manning (Campbell) is a workforce strategist working where construction, talent, and the future of the skilled trades collide.">
  <Nav />

  <!-- ── HERO ── -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="blueprint"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="eyebrow">About Liz Manning</div>
      <h1>They Are<br>The <em>Heroes.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Educators. Contractors. Apprentices. The people building something real every day — I'm here to make sure their story gets told.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── BIO OPENING: small photo left, large pull quote right ── -->
  <section class="bio-opening">
    <div class="bio-opening-photo">
      <img src="/AECABooth.jpg" alt="Liz Campbell at AECA" />
    </div>
    <div class="bio-opening-text">
      <h2 class="bio-pull">I'm Liz Manning (Campbell), a workforce strategist working where construction, talent, and the future of the skilled trades collide.</h2>
      <p>I did not come from a trades background, and I didn't take a traditional path into this industry. My career was built through relationships, work ethic, and learning the business from different perspectives.</p>
      <p>That experience is a big part of why I care so deeply about helping young people understand the opportunities that exist in the skilled trades.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── BIO CONTINUED ── -->
  <section class="bio-continued">
    <div class="bio-text">
      <p>For the past decade, I've worked alongside general contractors, subcontractors, trade associations, and statewide workforce initiatives to build apprenticeship programs, strengthen contractor engagement, and fix broken recruiting pipelines from the inside out. Today, I serve as the <strong>Director of Growth and Field Operations at Accuwright Mechanical</strong>, where I support an incredible team committed to growing people, strengthening the field, and building what comes next.</p>
      <p>That work has taken many forms. Building and operationalizing apprenticeship structures at the office, local, and federal level. Leading superintendents and field teams, and designing the playbooks and integration systems that hold field culture together. Raising money for high school construction programs, launching workforce alliances that connect contractors directly to classrooms, and building communication platforms that actually reflect the field.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── PULL QUOTE + SkillsUSA photo right ── -->
  <section class="pull-quote-section">
    <div class="pq-layout">
      <div class="pq-content">
        <div class="pq-mark">&ldquo;</div>
        <p class="pq-text">The work has never just been about programs. It's about changing the conversation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pq-photo">
        <img src="/SkillsUSAGeorgia2024.jpg" alt="Skills USA Georgia 2024" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── BIO FINAL ── -->
  <section class="bio-final">
    <div class="bio-text">
      <p>Students are not always shown the full picture. Parents are not always given the right information. Schools are not always connected to jobsite reality. And the construction industry has not always told its own story well.</p>
      <p class="bio-emphasis">That is the gap I am here to fix.</p>
      <p>Because the future of construction belongs to the organizations willing to build differently.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── FULL WIDTH SPEAKING PHOTO ── -->
  <section class="speaking-strip">
    <img src="/SkillsChallenge2025_Speaking.jpg" alt="Liz Campbell Speaking at Skills Challenge 2025" />
    <div class="speaking-caption">Skills Challenge 2025</div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── PODCASTS ── -->
  <section class="podcasts">
    <div class="podcasts-header">
      <div class="podcasts-header-text">
        <div class="section-label">Featured conversations</div>
        <h2>Industry Voices<br>from the Field.</h2>
        <p class="podcasts-intro">I've been part of some of the construction industry's most important conversations around workforce development, industry branding, and what it takes to attract the next generation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="podcasts-header-photo">
        <img src="/NECAPodcast.jpg" alt="Liz Campbell at NECA Podcast" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="recent-label">Recent Conversations</div>

    <div class="podcast-grid">

      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C7Myf5DWUVE&pp=ygUfY29uc3RydWN0aW9uIGRvcmtzIGxpeiBjYW1wYmVsbA%3D%3D" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="podcast-card">
        <div class="podcast-meta">
          <span class="podcast-show">Construction Dorks Podcast</span>
          <span class="podcast-ep">Episode 81</span>
        </div>
        <h4>Energizing Minds</h4>
        <div class="podcast-platform">Watch on YouTube</div>
      </a>

      <a href="https://youtu.be/UqziCq-r8fs?si=ljKLGnjqOfrmLlB2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="podcast-card">
        <div class="podcast-meta">
          <span class="podcast-show">BlackLine Podcast</span>
          <span class="podcast-ep">Featured Episode</span>
        </div>
        <h4>The Truth</h4>
        <div class="podcast-platform">Watch on YouTube</div>
      </a>

      <a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/0rcTGgN1ccKimzbzmcRFYQ?si=J-WxcEQCTNK_t82fSBkK-w" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="podcast-card">
        <div class="podcast-meta">
          <span class="podcast-show">NECA Innovation Podcast</span>
          <span class="podcast-ep">Episode 101 — Liz Campbell</span>
        </div>
        <h4>Contractor Takeover</h4>
        <div class="podcast-platform">Listen on Spotify</div>
      </a>

      <a href="https://youtu.be/hrTs3SL1h0U?si=NO2dz8K3lGtpFW7f" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="podcast-card">
        <div class="podcast-meta">
          <span class="podcast-show">Build America Podcast</span>
          <span class="podcast-ep">Featured Episode</span>
        </div>
        <h4>How Important is Your Organization's Brand in Recruiting?</h4>
        <div class="podcast-platform">Watch on YouTube</div>
      </a>

    </div>

    <a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/16oRgsML9BB6F3cUIWCCLu?si=914a82cb7d764e2b" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="podcast-card podcast-card--full">
      <div class="podcast-meta">
        <span class="podcast-show">The Alternating Current Podcast — Atlanta Electrical Contractors Association</span>
        <span class="podcast-ep">Former Host</span>
      </div>
      <h4>The Alternating Current Podcast</h4>
      <p class="podcast-desc">Hosted and produced an industry podcast elevating contractor voices and increasing visibility for the electrical contracting industry in the state of Georgia.</p>
      <div class="podcast-platform">Listen on Spotify</div>
    </a>

  </section>

  <!-- ── HOW I HELP ── -->
  <section class="how-help">
    <div class="hh-inner">
      <div class="section-label">How I help</div>
      <h2>Build <em>Differently.</em></h2>
      <p class="hh-lede">I work with the organizations willing to do the harder, better version of workforce development. What that looks like is different for everyone — but it usually starts in one of these places:</p>
      <div class="hh-grid">
        <div class="hh-item">
          <h3>Keeping the People You Hire</h3>
          <p>The systems that hold a craft worker past year one — onboarding, mentorship, a clear path forward, apprenticeship that actually works. Recruiting is the easy part; retention is where the money leaks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hh-item">
          <h3>Building a Real Pipeline</h3>
          <p>Recruiting strategy that produces hires instead of noise, and school partnerships that connect your jobsites to the classroom before graduation — not after.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hh-item">
          <h3>Telling the Story Straight</h3>
          <p>Employer branding and communication that sound like the field, not a brochure. The trades don't need spin. They need the truth told well.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="hh-close">Every company is in a different spot, so I don't start with a package — I start with a conversation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── CTA ── -->
  <section class="about-cta">
    <div class="fc-grid"></div>
    <p class="cta-pre">The future of the workforce is built by the people in this industry.</p>
    <h2>Let's Make Sure<br>Their Story Gets <em>Told.</em></h2>
    <div class="cta-btns">
      <a href="mailto:liz@tradebuiltga.com" class="btn-cream">Let's Talk</a>
      <a href="/study" class="btn-outline">Participate in the Study</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Partners />

  <Footer />

</Layout>

<style>
  /* ── HOW I HELP ── */
  .how-help {
    background: var(--tb-bg-base);
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    padding: 88px 40px;
  }
  .hh-inner { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .how-help h2 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--tb-text-cream); margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .how-help h2 em {
    font-style: normal; color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1.2px var(--tb-text-cream);
  }
  .hh-lede {
    font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--tb-text-muted);
    max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .hh-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }
  .hh-item { border-top: 2px solid #c17830; padding-top: 20px; }
  .hh-item h3 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 21px; text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: var(--tb-text-cream); margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .hh-item p { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--tb-text-dim); }
  .hh-close {
    font-size: 18px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--tb-text-cream); max-width: 720px;
    border-left: 3px solid #c17830; padding-left: 20px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .how-help { padding: 56px 24px; }
    .hh-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .how-help h2 { font-size: 36px; }
  }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .about-hero {
    padding: 80px 40px 64px;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--tb-bg-deep);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .blueprint {
    position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(232,227,213,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(232,227,213,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 48px 48px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--tb-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    padding: 6px 14px;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 80px;
    line-height: 0.93;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--tb-text-cream);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-hero h1 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px var(--tb-text-cream);
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--tb-text-dim);
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* ── BIO OPENING ── */
.bio-opening {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 380px 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    background: var(--tb-bg-base);
    min-height: 480px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .bio-opening-photo {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-right: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .bio-opening-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    display: block;
  }

  .bio-opening-text {
    padding: 48px 48px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

.bio-pull {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--tb-text-cream);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .bio-opening-text p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--tb-text-dim);
  }

  .bio-opening-text p strong {
    color: var(--tb-text-cream);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ── BIO CONTINUED ── */
.bio-continued {
    padding: 56px 40px;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    background: var(--tb-bg-deep);
  }

.bio-continued .bio-text {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 60px;
  }

  .bio-text {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .bio-text p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--tb-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .bio-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .bio-text p strong {
    color: var(--tb-text-cream);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ── PULL QUOTE ── */
  .pull-quote-section {
    padding: 64px 40px;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    background: var(--tb-bg-deep);
  }

  .pq-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pq-mark {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 80px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--tb-border-mid);
    line-height: 0.6;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .pq-text {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--tb-text-cream);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .pq-photo {
    border: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .pq-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 320px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    display: block;
  }

  /* ── BIO FINAL ── */
  .bio-final {
    padding: 56px 40px;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    background: var(--tb-bg-base);
  }

  .bio-emphasis {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 26px !important;
    font-weight: 700 !important;
    color: var(--tb-text-cream) !important;
    line-height: 1.2 !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin: 4px 0 20px !important;
  }

  /* ── SPEAKING STRIP ── */
  .speaking-strip {
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    overflow: hidden;
    height: 560px;
  }

  .speaking-strip img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 25%;
    display: block;
  }

  .speaking-caption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    right: 24px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(232,227,213,0.5);
  }

  /* ── PODCASTS ── */
.podcasts {
    padding: 64px 40px;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    background: var(--tb-bg-base);
  }

.podcasts-header,
.podcast-grid,
.podcast-card--full,
.recent-label {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .podcasts-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .podcasts-header-photo {
    border: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .podcasts-header-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 260px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    display: block;
  }

  .podcasts h2 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 42px;
    line-height: 1.05;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--tb-text-cream);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .podcasts-intro {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--tb-text-dim);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .recent-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--tb-text-ghost);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
  }

  .podcast-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .podcast-card {
    background: var(--tb-bg-deep);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    padding: 18px;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .podcast-card:hover { border-color: var(--tb-border-mid); }

  .podcast-card--full {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .podcast-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .podcast-show {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--tb-text-ghost);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .podcast-ep {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--tb-text-faint);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .podcast-card h4 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--tb-text-cream);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .podcast-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--tb-text-dim);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .podcast-platform {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 5px 10px;
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    color: var(--tb-text-dim);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    margin-top: auto;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  /* ── CTA ── */
  .about-cta {
    padding: 80px 40px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(14,21,32,0.62), rgba(14,21,32,0.8)), url('/photo-steel-rust.jpg') center / cover no-repeat;
  }

  .fc-grid {
    position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(232,227,213,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(232,227,213,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 48px 48px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .cta-pre {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--tb-text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    position: relative;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .about-cta h2 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 52px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--tb-text-cream);
    line-height: 0.95;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-cta h2 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px var(--tb-text-cream);
  }

  .cta-btns {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  .site-footer {
    padding: 18px 40px;
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--tb-bg-deep);
  }

  .footer-logo {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--tb-text-ghost);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .footer-logo span { color: var(--tb-text-dark); }
  .footer-copy { font-size: 14px; color: var(--tb-text-dark); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }

  /* ── SECTION LABEL ── */
  .section-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--tb-text-ghost);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .section-label::after {
    content: '';
    flex: 1;
    height: 0.5px;
    background: var(--tb-border);
  }

  /* ── MOBILE ── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-hero { padding: 56px 24px 48px; }
    .about-hero h1 { font-size: 52px; }
    .hero-sub { font-size: 15px; }

    .bio-opening {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .bio-opening-photo {
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--tb-border);
      height: 280px;
    }

    .bio-opening-text { padding: 36px 24px; }
    .bio-pull { font-size: 24px; }

    .bio-continued { padding: 48px 24px; }
    .bio-final { padding: 48px 24px; }

    .pull-quote-section { padding: 48px 24px; }
    .pq-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .pq-text { font-size: 24px; }
    .pq-photo img { height: 220px; }

    .speaking-strip { height: 320px; }

    .podcasts { padding: 48px 24px; }
    .podcasts-header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
